window.ROTACARE_QA=[{"number":1,"section":"Safety and first response","question":"I may be having a medical emergency. Can this clinic treat me?","answer":"The source documents do not describe emergency services. For a life-threatening emergency, call 911 or go to the nearest emergency department. Do not wait for a clinic callback.","followUp":"Ask whether the caller has severe or life-threatening symptoms.","sourceNote":"Safety guidance; the emergency-care statement is not a clinic service promise.","answerZh":"源文件没有描述紧急服务。对于危及生命的紧急情况，请拨打 911 或前往最近的急诊室。不要等待诊所回电。","answerEs":"Los documentos originales no describen los servicios de emergencia. Para una emergencia que ponga en peligro la vida, llame al 911 o vaya al departamento de emergencias más cercano. No espere una devolución de llamada de la clínica."},{"number":2,"section":"Safety and first response","question":"What basic eligibility questions should I ask first?","answer":"The clinic serves community members who are 18 or older, do not have medical insurance, and have limited finances.","followUp":"Ask: What is your age? Do you currently have medical insurance? Are your finances limited?","sourceNote":null,"answerZh":"该诊所为年满 18 岁、没有医疗保险且经济有限的社区成员提供服务。","answerEs":"La clínica atiende a miembros de la comunidad que tienen 18 años o más, no tienen seguro médico y tienen finanzas limitadas."},{"number":3,"section":"Safety and first response","question":"What basic clinical question should I ask?","answer":"Use the answers to compare the request with the documented scope below. Clinical urgency must be assessed by a qualified medical professional.","followUp":"Ask for the main symptom or reason for the visit, how long it has been present, and whether there was a serious injury.","sourceNote":null,"answerZh":"使用答案将请求与下面记录的范围进行比较。临床紧迫性必须由合格的医疗专业人员进行评估。","answerEs":"Utilice las respuestas para comparar la solicitud con el alcance documentado a continuación. La urgencia clínica debe ser evaluada por un profesional médico calificado."},{"number":4,"section":"Eligibility","question":"What ages does the clinic serve?","answer":"Patients must be 18 years of age or older.","followUp":null,"sourceNote":null,"answerZh":"患者必须年满 18 岁。","answerEs":"Los pacientes deben tener 18 años de edad o más."},{"number":5,"section":"Eligibility","question":"I am 17. Can I be seen?","answer":"No, not under the documented eligibility rule. The clinic serves patients age 18 and older.","followUp":null,"sourceNote":null,"answerZh":"不，不符合书面资格规则。该诊所为 18 岁及以上的患者提供服务。","answerEs":"No, no según la regla de elegibilidad documentada. La clínica atiende a pacientes mayores de 18 años."},{"number":6,"section":"Eligibility","question":"I am exactly 18. Can I be seen?","answer":"Age-wise, yes. You must also have no medical insurance and have limited finances.","followUp":null,"sourceNote":null,"answerZh":"从年龄来看，是的。您还必须没有医疗保险并且财务状况有限。","answerEs":"En cuanto a la edad, sí. Tampoco debe tener seguro médico y tener finanzas limitadas."},{"number":7,"section":"Eligibility","question":"Do I need to be uninsured?","answer":"Yes. The clinic description says appointments are for people who do not have medical insurance.","followUp":null,"sourceNote":null,"answerZh":"是的。诊所的描述称，预约是为没有医疗保险的人提供的。","answerEs":"Sí. La descripción de la clínica dice que las citas son para personas que no tienen seguro médico."},{"number":8,"section":"Eligibility","question":"I have medical insurance. Can I still use the clinic?","answer":"The documented eligibility criteria specify people without medical insurance. Call the clinic if you need clarification about your situation.","followUp":null,"sourceNote":null,"answerZh":"记录的资格标准指定了没有医疗保险的人。如果您需要澄清您的情况，请致电诊所。","answerEs":"Los criterios de elegibilidad documentados especifican personas sin seguro médico. Llame a la clínica si necesita aclaración sobre su situación."},{"number":9,"section":"Eligibility","question":"Is the clinic only for people with limited finances?","answer":"Yes. Limited finances are part of the documented eligibility criteria.","followUp":null,"sourceNote":null,"answerZh":"是的。有限的财务状况是已记录的资格标准的一部分。","answerEs":"Sí. Las finanzas limitadas son parte de los criterios de elegibilidad documentados."},{"number":10,"section":"Eligibility","question":"What proof of age, insurance status, income, or finances is required?","answer":"The documents do not specify required proof or documents. Call 408-715-3088 and leave a message to ask.","followUp":null,"sourceNote":null,"answerZh":"这些文件没有指定所需的证明或文件。拨打408-715-3088并留言询问。","answerEs":"Los documentos no especifican pruebas o documentos requeridos. Llame al 408-715-3088 y deje un mensaje para preguntar."},{"number":11,"section":"Eligibility","question":"Do I need to live in San Jose or Santa Clara County?","answer":"The documents say the clinic serves all community members who meet the eligibility criteria, but they do not state a residency boundary.","followUp":null,"sourceNote":null,"answerZh":"文件称，该诊所为所有符合资格标准的社区成员提供服务，但没有说明居住范围。","answerEs":"Los documentos dicen que la clínica atiende a todos los miembros de la comunidad que cumplen con los criterios de elegibilidad, pero no establecen un límite de residencia."},{"number":12,"section":"Cost, language, and access","question":"How much does an appointment cost?","answer":"Appointments are free of charge.","followUp":null,"sourceNote":null,"answerZh":"预约是免费的。","answerEs":"Las citas son gratuitas."},{"number":13,"section":"Cost, language, and access","question":"Are services available in English?","answer":"Yes. Appointments are offered in English.","followUp":null,"sourceNote":null,"answerZh":"是的。预约以英语提供。","answerEs":"Sí. Las citas se ofrecen en inglés."},{"number":14,"section":"Cost, language, and access","question":"Are services available in Spanish?","answer":"Yes. Appointments are offered in Spanish, and Spanish-language interpreters are available.","followUp":null,"sourceNote":null,"answerZh":"是的。预约以西班牙语进行，并提供西班牙语口译员。","answerEs":"Sí. Las citas se ofrecen en español y hay intérpretes de español disponibles."},{"number":15,"section":"Cost, language, and access","question":"Are interpreters available for languages other than Spanish?","answer":"The documents mention Spanish interpreters only; other languages are not specified.","followUp":null,"sourceNote":null,"answerZh":"这些文件仅提到西班牙语口译员；其他语言未指定。","answerEs":"Los documentos mencionan únicamente a intérpretes de español; otros idiomas no están especificados."},{"number":16,"section":"Cost, language, and access","question":"Are accessibility accommodations available?","answer":"The documents do not specify disability or accessibility accommodations. Call to ask.","followUp":null,"sourceNote":null,"answerZh":"这些文件没有具体说明残疾或无障碍设施。打电话询问。","answerEs":"Los documentos no especifican adaptaciones para personas con discapacidad o accesibilidad. Llame para preguntar."},{"number":17,"section":"Appointments and callbacks","question":"How do I schedule an appointment?","answer":"Call 408-715-3088 and leave a message with your name, telephone number, and the reason for your call. The clinic will call you back to schedule.","followUp":null,"sourceNote":null,"answerZh":"请致电 408-715-3088，并留言并注明您的姓名、电话号码和致电原因。诊所会按预约时间给您回电话。","answerEs":"Llame al 408-715-3088 y deje un mensaje con su nombre, número de teléfono y el motivo de su llamada. La clínica le devolverá la llamada para programar."},{"number":18,"section":"Appointments and callbacks","question":"What information must I leave in my voicemail?","answer":"Leave your name, telephone number, and reason for calling.","followUp":null,"sourceNote":null,"answerZh":"留下您的姓名、电话号码和致电原因。","answerEs":"Deje su nombre, número de teléfono y motivo de su llamada."},{"number":19,"section":"Appointments and callbacks","question":"Will the clinic call me back from its public phone number?","answer":"Not necessarily. The documents warn that returned calls will come from a blocked or private number.","followUp":null,"sourceNote":null,"answerZh":"未必。文件警告说，回电将来自被屏蔽或私人号码。","answerEs":"No necesariamente. Los documentos advierten que las llamadas devueltas provendrán de un número bloqueado o privado."},{"number":20,"section":"Appointments and callbacks","question":"When are telephone appointments offered?","answer":"Telephone appointments are offered every Wednesday evening.","followUp":null,"sourceNote":null,"answerZh":"每周三晚上提供电话预约。","answerEs":"Se ofrecen citas telefónicas todos los miércoles por la noche."},{"number":21,"section":"Appointments and callbacks","question":"When are in-person appointments offered?","answer":"In-person clinic appointments are offered on the first and third Wednesday evenings of each month.","followUp":null,"sourceNote":null,"answerZh":"每个月的第一个和第三个周三晚上提供面对面诊所预约。","answerEs":"Las citas clínicas en persona se ofrecen el primer y tercer miércoles por la noche de cada mes."},{"number":22,"section":"Appointments and callbacks","question":"What time do appointments begin?","answer":"Appointments start at 5:00 PM.","followUp":null,"sourceNote":null,"answerZh":"预约从下午 5:00 开始。","answerEs":"Las citas comienzan a las 5:00 p.m."},{"number":23,"section":"Appointments and callbacks","question":"Can I choose a telephone or in-clinic appointment?","answer":"Both types are offered, subject to the clinic schedule and availability. The documents do not promise that every request will receive the caller's preferred type.","followUp":null,"sourceNote":null,"answerZh":"两种类型均提供，具体取决于诊所的时间表和供应情况。这些文档并不承诺每个请求都会收到调用者的首选类型。","answerEs":"Se ofrecen ambos tipos, sujetos al horario y disponibilidad de la clínica. Los documentos no prometen que cada solicitud recibirá el tipo preferido de la persona que llama."},{"number":24,"section":"Appointments and callbacks","question":"Are video appointments offered?","answer":"The documents mention telephone appointments, not video appointments.","followUp":null,"sourceNote":null,"answerZh":"文件提到的是电话预约，而不是视频预约。","answerEs":"Los documentos mencionan citas telefónicas, no citas por vídeo."},{"number":25,"section":"Appointments and callbacks","question":"Are appointments available on days other than Wednesday?","answer":"The documents list Wednesday evenings only.","followUp":null,"sourceNote":null,"answerZh":"文件仅列出周三晚上。","answerEs":"Los documentos enumeran únicamente los miércoles por la noche."},{"number":26,"section":"Appointments and callbacks","question":"Are walk-in visits available?","answer":"Walk-in availability is not stated. The documented process is to call and schedule.","followUp":null,"sourceNote":null,"answerZh":"没有说明是否可以直接上门。记录的流程是致电和安排。","answerEs":"No se indica la disponibilidad sin cita previa. El proceso documentado es llamar y programar."},{"number":27,"section":"Appointments and callbacks","question":"How quickly will the clinic return my call?","answer":"The callback time is not specified.","followUp":null,"sourceNote":null,"answerZh":"未指定回调时间。","answerEs":"No se especifica el tiempo de devolución de llamada."},{"number":28,"section":"Appointments and callbacks","question":"Can I schedule by email or online?","answer":"The documented scheduling method is telephone voicemail. An email address is listed for the clinic, but the documents do not say it can be used to schedule.","followUp":null,"sourceNote":null,"answerZh":"记录的调度方法是电话语音邮件。列出了诊所的电子邮件地址，但文件没有说它可以用来安排时间。","answerEs":"El método de programación documentado es el correo de voz telefónico. Aparece una dirección de correo electrónico para la clínica, pero los documentos no dicen que pueda usarse para programar una cita."},{"number":29,"section":"Appointments and callbacks","question":"Can I cancel or reschedule an appointment?","answer":"The documents do not give a cancellation policy. Call 408-715-3088 and leave a message.","followUp":null,"sourceNote":null,"answerZh":"这些文件没有给出取消政策。拨打 408-715-3088 并留言。","answerEs":"Los documentos no dan una política de cancelación. Llame al 408-715-3088 y deje un mensaje."},{"number":30,"section":"Location and contacts","question":"Where is the clinic?","answer":"RotaCare San Jose Free Medical Clinic is at 100 Oak Street, San Jose, CA 95110.","followUp":null,"sourceNote":null,"answerZh":"RotaCare 圣何塞免费医疗诊所位于 100 Oak Street, San Jose, CA 95110。","answerEs":"La clínica médica gratuita RotaCare San Jose está en 100 Oak Street, San José, CA 95110."},{"number":31,"section":"Location and contacts","question":"Which building is the clinic in?","answer":"It is in the Washington Neighborhood Health Clinic building at Washington Elementary.","followUp":null,"sourceNote":null,"answerZh":"它位于华盛顿小学的华盛顿邻里健康诊所大楼内。","answerEs":"Está en el edificio de la Clínica de Salud Comunitaria de Washington en la Escuela Primaria Washington."},{"number":32,"section":"Location and contacts","question":"Where is the clinic entrance?","answer":"The entrance is on Edwards Avenue, one street south of Oak Street.","followUp":null,"sourceNote":null,"answerZh":"入口位于爱德华兹大道，即橡树街以南的一条街道。","answerEs":"La entrada está en Edwards Avenue, una calle al sur de Oak Street."},{"number":33,"section":"Location and contacts","question":"What is the clinic phone number?","answer":"The clinic phone number is (408) 715-3088.","followUp":null,"sourceNote":null,"answerZh":"诊所电话号码是 (408) 715-3088。","answerEs":"El número de teléfono de la clínica es (408) 715-3088."},{"number":34,"section":"Location and contacts","question":"What is the clinic email address?","answer":"The clinic email is sjclinic@rotacarebayarea.org.","followUp":null,"sourceNote":null,"answerZh":"诊所的电子邮件是 sjclinic@rotacarebayarea.org。","answerEs":"El correo electrónico de la clínica es sjclinic@rotacarebayarea.org."},{"number":35,"section":"Location and contacts","question":"Who is the Clinic Operations Manager?","answer":"The document lists Jasmine Ramirez.","followUp":null,"sourceNote":null,"answerZh":"该文件列出了茉莉花·拉米雷斯 (Jasmine Ramirez) 的名单。","answerEs":"El documento enumera a Jazmín Ramírez."},{"number":36,"section":"Location and contacts","question":"Who is the Medical Director?","answer":"The document lists Bruce Frambach, MD.","followUp":null,"sourceNote":null,"answerZh":"该文件列出了医学博士 Bruce Frambach。","answerEs":"El documento enumera a Bruce Frambach, MD."},{"number":37,"section":"Location and contacts","question":"Is parking or public transportation information available?","answer":"The documents do not provide parking or transportation information.","followUp":null,"sourceNote":null,"answerZh":"这些文件不提供停车或交通信息。","answerEs":"Los documentos no proporcionan información sobre estacionamiento o transporte."},{"number":38,"section":"Services the clinic offers","question":"Who performs medical evaluations?","answer":"A physician, physician assistant (PA), or nurse practitioner (NP) may perform the medical evaluation.","followUp":null,"sourceNote":null,"answerZh":"医师、医师助理 (PA) 或执业护士 (NP) 可以进行医学评估。","answerEs":"Un médico, asistente médico (PA) o enfermero practicante (NP) puede realizar la evaluación médica."},{"number":39,"section":"Services the clinic offers","question":"Can the clinic prescribe medication?","answer":"Yes, prescriptions are listed as an offered service. The documents also state that narcotic medications are not provided.","followUp":null,"sourceNote":null,"answerZh":"是的，处方被列为所提供的服务。文件还指出，不提供麻醉药品。","answerEs":"Sí, las recetas figuran como un servicio ofrecido. Los documentos también afirman que no se proporcionan medicamentos narcóticos."},{"number":40,"section":"Services the clinic offers","question":"Can the clinic order laboratory testing?","answer":"Yes. Laboratory testing is listed as an offered service.","followUp":null,"sourceNote":null,"answerZh":"是的。实验室测试被列为所提供的服务。","answerEs":"Sí. Las pruebas de laboratorio figuran como un servicio ofrecido."},{"number":41,"section":"Services the clinic offers","question":"Can the clinic arrange imaging?","answer":"The clinic offers imaging referrals; the documents do not say imaging is performed onsite.","followUp":null,"sourceNote":null,"answerZh":"诊所提供影像转诊服务；文件没有说成像是在现场进行的。","answerEs":"La clínica ofrece referencias para imágenes; Los documentos no dicen que las imágenes se realicen en el sitio."},{"number":42,"section":"Services the clinic offers","question":"Can the clinic refer me to a specialist?","answer":"Yes. When appropriate, the clinic may refer patients to specialty clinics at Santa Clara Valley Medical Center.","followUp":null,"sourceNote":null,"answerZh":"是的。在适当的情况下，诊所可能会将患者转介至圣克拉拉谷医疗中心的专科诊所。","answerEs":"Sí. Cuando sea apropiado, la clínica puede derivar pacientes a clínicas especializadas en Santa Clara Valley Medical Center."},{"number":43,"section":"Services the clinic offers","question":"Can the clinic refer me to other community services?","answer":"Yes. Referrals to other community services are listed as an offered service.","followUp":null,"sourceNote":null,"answerZh":"是的。向其他社区服务的转介被列为所提供的服务。","answerEs":"Sí. Las referencias a otros servicios comunitarios se enumeran como un servicio ofrecido."},{"number":44,"section":"Services the clinic offers","question":"Does the clinic provide ongoing primary care?","answer":"The documents describe acute-care visits and evaluation of certain chronic conditions. They encourage patients with chronic conditions to apply for Medi-Cal for ongoing care.","followUp":null,"sourceNote":null,"answerZh":"这些文件描述了急性护理就诊和某些慢性病的评估。他们鼓励慢性病患者申请 Medi-Cal 以获得持续护理。","answerEs":"Los documentos describen visitas de cuidados intensivos y evaluación de ciertas condiciones crónicas. Animan a los pacientes con enfermedades crónicas a solicitar Medi-Cal para recibir atención continua."},{"number":45,"section":"Services the clinic offers","question":"Can the clinic help with a Medi-Cal application?","answer":"The documents encourage patients with chronic conditions to apply for Medi-Cal, but they do not state that the clinic provides enrollment assistance.","followUp":null,"sourceNote":null,"answerZh":"这些文件鼓励慢性病患者申请 Medi-Cal，但没有说明诊所提供注册援助。","answerEs":"Los documentos alientan a los pacientes con enfermedades crónicas a solicitar Medi-Cal, pero no establecen que la clínica brinde asistencia para la inscripción."},{"number":46,"section":"Symptoms and conditions","question":"I have flu symptoms. Can the clinic evaluate me?","answer":"Yes. Flu symptoms are listed as an example of minor acute illness the clinic evaluates.","followUp":"First confirm age, uninsured status, limited finances, and whether symptoms are severe.","sourceNote":null,"answerZh":"是的。流感症状被列为诊所评估的轻微急性疾病的一个例子。","answerEs":"Sí. Los síntomas de la gripe se enumeran como un ejemplo de enfermedad aguda menor que evalúa la clínica."},{"number":47,"section":"Symptoms and conditions","question":"I have asthma symptoms. Can the clinic evaluate me?","answer":"Yes. Asthma symptoms are within the documented acute-care scope.","followUp":"Ask whether the person is having severe trouble breathing; severe symptoms may require emergency care.","sourceNote":null,"answerZh":"是的。哮喘症状属于记录在案的急性护理范围内。","answerEs":"Sí. Los síntomas del asma están dentro del alcance documentado de los cuidados intensivos."},{"number":48,"section":"Symptoms and conditions","question":"I have joint pain. Can the clinic evaluate me?","answer":"Yes, joint pains are listed. Significant trauma and acute fracture management are not within the clinic's capabilities.","followUp":"Ask whether the pain followed significant trauma or may involve a fracture.","sourceNote":null,"answerZh":"是的，列出了关节疼痛。严重创伤和急性骨折的处理不在诊所的能力范围内。","answerEs":"Sí, se enumeran los dolores articulares. El tratamiento de traumatismos importantes y fracturas agudas no está dentro de las capacidades de la clínica."},{"number":49,"section":"Symptoms and conditions","question":"I have seasonal allergies. Can the clinic evaluate me?","answer":"Yes. Seasonal allergies are listed within the acute-care scope.","followUp":null,"sourceNote":null,"answerZh":"是的。季节性过敏属于急症护理范围。","answerEs":"Sí. Las alergias estacionales se incluyen dentro del ámbito de cuidados intensivos."},{"number":50,"section":"Symptoms and conditions","question":"I have a skin rash. Can the clinic evaluate me?","answer":"Yes. Skin rashes are listed within the acute-care scope.","followUp":null,"sourceNote":null,"answerZh":"是的。皮疹属于急性护理范围。","answerEs":"Sí. Las erupciones cutáneas se incluyen dentro del ámbito de cuidados intensivos."},{"number":51,"section":"Symptoms and conditions","question":"I may have a minor infection. Can the clinic evaluate me?","answer":"Yes. Minor infections are listed within the acute-care scope.","followUp":null,"sourceNote":null,"answerZh":"是的。轻微感染属于急性护理范围。","answerEs":"Sí. Las infecciones menores se enumeran dentro del ámbito de cuidados intensivos."},{"number":52,"section":"Symptoms and conditions","question":"I have stomach pain. Can the clinic evaluate me?","answer":"Yes. Stomach pains are listed within the acute-care scope.","followUp":"Ask whether the pain is severe or accompanied by emergency warning signs.","sourceNote":null,"answerZh":"是的。胃痛属于急性护理范围。","answerEs":"Sí. Los dolores de estómago se enumeran dentro del ámbito de cuidados intensivos."},{"number":53,"section":"Symptoms and conditions","question":"I have a minor illness or minor injury not specifically listed. Can I call?","answer":"The listed conditions are examples, not necessarily a complete list. Call and describe the problem so the clinic can determine whether it fits its scope.","followUp":null,"sourceNote":null,"answerZh":"列出的条件只是示例，不一定是完整列表。致电并描述问题，以便诊所确定问题是否符合其范围。","answerEs":"Las condiciones enumeradas son ejemplos, no necesariamente una lista completa. Llame y describa el problema para que la clínica pueda determinar si se ajusta a su alcance."},{"number":54,"section":"Symptoms and conditions","question":"I may have a broken bone or acute fracture. Can the clinic treat it?","answer":"No. The clinic states that it is not equipped to manage significant trauma-related injuries such as acute fractures.","followUp":null,"sourceNote":null,"answerZh":"不可以。该诊所声明其没有能力处理严重的创伤相关伤害，例如急性骨折。","answerEs":"No. La clínica afirma que no está equipada para tratar lesiones importantes relacionadas con traumatismos, como fracturas agudas."},{"number":55,"section":"Symptoms and conditions","question":"I have a cut that may need stitches. Can the clinic suture it?","answer":"No. Suturing skin wounds is specifically outside the clinic's capabilities.","followUp":null,"sourceNote":null,"answerZh":"不可以。缝合皮肤伤口超出了诊所的能力范围。","answerEs":"No. La sutura de heridas en la piel está específicamente fuera de las capacidades de la clínica."},{"number":56,"section":"Symptoms and conditions","question":"Can the clinic evaluate diabetes?","answer":"Yes. Diabetes is listed as a chronic condition the clinic evaluates. Patients are encouraged to apply for Medi-Cal for ongoing care.","followUp":null,"sourceNote":null,"answerZh":"是的。糖尿病被列为诊所评估的慢性疾病。我们鼓励患者申请 Medi-Cal 以获得持续护理。","answerEs":"Sí. La diabetes figura como una condición crónica que la clínica evalúa. Se anima a los pacientes a solicitar Medi-Cal para recibir atención continua."},{"number":57,"section":"Symptoms and conditions","question":"Can the clinic evaluate high blood pressure?","answer":"Yes. High blood pressure is listed as a chronic condition the clinic evaluates. Ongoing care through medical insurance is encouraged.","followUp":null,"sourceNote":null,"answerZh":"是的。高血压被诊所评估为慢性疾病。鼓励通过医疗保险进行持续护理。","answerEs":"Sí. La presión arterial alta figura como una condición crónica que la clínica evalúa. Se fomenta la atención continua a través de un seguro médico."},{"number":58,"section":"Symptoms and conditions","question":"Can the clinic evaluate a thyroid disorder?","answer":"Yes. Thyroid disorders are listed as chronic conditions the clinic evaluates. Ongoing care through medical insurance is encouraged.","followUp":null,"sourceNote":null,"answerZh":"是的。甲状腺疾病被列为诊所评估的慢性疾病。鼓励通过医疗保险进行持续护理。","answerEs":"Sí. Los trastornos de la tiroides figuran como afecciones crónicas que evalúa la clínica. Se fomenta la atención continua a través de un seguro médico."},{"number":59,"section":"Symptoms and conditions","question":"Does the clinic offer gynecology services?","answer":"Limited availability may exist because some providers provide office gynecology services. However, the same source says the clinic is not able to provide general women's health services. Call with the specific request so staff can confirm whether it can be handled.","followUp":null,"sourceNote":"This wording preserves both statements in the source document.","answerZh":"由于一些提供者提供办公室妇科服务，因此可用性可能有限。然而，同一消息人士称，该诊所无法提供一般女性健康服务。致电提出具体要求，以便工作人员确认是否可以处理。","answerEs":"Puede existir disponibilidad limitada porque algunos proveedores brindan servicios de ginecología en el consultorio. Sin embargo, la misma fuente dice que la clínica no puede proporcionar servicios generales de salud para mujeres. Llame con la solicitud específica para que el personal pueda confirmar si se puede manejar."},{"number":60,"section":"Services the clinic does not offer","question":"I have a toothache. Does the clinic offer dental care?","answer":"No. Dental services are specifically listed as unavailable. The clinic does list referrals to other community services, but the documents do not guarantee a dental referral. Call 408-715-3088 to ask about possible resources.","followUp":"Ask the caller's age and basic eligibility, then identify the request as dental.","sourceNote":null,"answerZh":"不可以。牙科服务被明确列为不可用。该诊所确实列出了其他社区服务的转诊，但这些文件并不保证牙科转诊。请致电 408-715-3088 询问可能的资源。","answerEs":"No. Los servicios dentales figuran específicamente como no disponibles. La clínica enumera referencias a otros servicios comunitarios, pero los documentos no garantizan una referencia dental. Llame al 408-715-3088 para preguntar sobre posibles recursos."},{"number":61,"section":"Services the clinic does not offer","question":"Does the clinic have a dentist?","answer":"No dental service is offered according to the source document.","followUp":null,"sourceNote":null,"answerZh":"根据源文件，不提供牙科服务。","answerEs":"No se ofrece ningún servicio odontológico según el documento fuente."},{"number":62,"section":"Services the clinic does not offer","question":"Can the clinic perform tuberculosis (TB) testing?","answer":"No. TB testing is specifically listed as unavailable.","followUp":null,"sourceNote":null,"answerZh":"不可以。结核病检测被明确列为不可用。","answerEs":"No. Las pruebas de tuberculosis figuran específicamente como no disponibles."},{"number":63,"section":"Services the clinic does not offer","question":"Does the clinic provide general women's health services?","answer":"No, general women's health services are listed as unavailable. Some providers may offer limited office gynecology, so call about the specific need.","followUp":null,"sourceNote":null,"answerZh":"不，一般妇女保健服务被列为不可用。一些提供者可能提供有限的办公室妇科服务，因此请致电询问具体需求。","answerEs":"No, los servicios generales de salud para la mujer figuran como no disponibles. Algunos proveedores pueden ofrecer ginecología en el consultorio de forma limitada, así que llame si tiene una necesidad específica."},{"number":64,"section":"Services the clinic does not offer","question":"Does the clinic treat sexually transmitted diseases or infections?","answer":"No. STD treatment is specifically listed as unavailable.","followUp":null,"sourceNote":null,"answerZh":"不可以。STD 治疗被明确列为不可用。","answerEs":"No. El tratamiento para las ETS figura específicamente como no disponible."},{"number":65,"section":"Services the clinic does not offer","question":"Does the clinic provide mental health services?","answer":"No. Mental health services are specifically listed as unavailable.","followUp":null,"sourceNote":null,"answerZh":"不可以。心理健康服务被明确列为不可用。","answerEs":"No. Los servicios de salud mental figuran específicamente como no disponibles."},{"number":66,"section":"Services the clinic does not offer","question":"Does the clinic provide vision or eye-care services?","answer":"No. Vision services are specifically listed as unavailable.","followUp":null,"sourceNote":null,"answerZh":"不可以。视觉服务被明确列为不可用。","answerEs":"No. Los servicios de la vista se enumeran específicamente como no disponibles."},{"number":67,"section":"Services the clinic does not offer","question":"Can the clinic perform an examination to determine disability?","answer":"No. Examinations to determine disability are specifically listed as unavailable.","followUp":null,"sourceNote":null,"answerZh":"不可以。确定残疾的检查被明确列为不可用。","answerEs":"No. Los exámenes para determinar la discapacidad figuran específicamente como no disponibles."},{"number":68,"section":"Services the clinic does not offer","question":"Does the clinic provide chronic pain management?","answer":"No. Chronic pain management is specifically listed as unavailable.","followUp":null,"sourceNote":null,"answerZh":"不可以。慢性疼痛管理被明确列为不可用。","answerEs":"No. El tratamiento del dolor crónico figura específicamente como no disponible."},{"number":69,"section":"Services the clinic does not offer","question":"Can the clinic prescribe narcotic medication?","answer":"No. Narcotic medications are specifically listed as unavailable.","followUp":null,"sourceNote":null,"answerZh":"不可以。麻醉药品被明确列为不可用。","answerEs":"No. Los medicamentos narcóticos figuran específicamente como no disponibles."},{"number":70,"section":"Services the clinic does not offer","question":"Does the clinic perform surgery or surgical procedures?","answer":"No. Surgical procedures are specifically listed as unavailable.","followUp":null,"sourceNote":null,"answerZh":"不可以。手术程序被明确列为不可用。","answerEs":"No. Los procedimientos quirúrgicos se enumeran específicamente como no disponibles."},{"number":71,"section":"Services the clinic does not offer","question":"Does the clinic give vaccinations?","answer":"No. The source states that the clinic is not currently offering vaccinations of any kind.","followUp":null,"sourceNote":null,"answerZh":"不。消息人士称，该诊所目前不提供任何类型的疫苗接种。","answerEs":"No. La fuente afirma que la clínica no ofrece actualmente vacunas de ningún tipo."},{"number":72,"section":"Services the clinic does not offer","question":"Can the clinic treat a major trauma injury?","answer":"No. The clinic is not equipped for significant trauma-related injuries, including acute-fracture management or suturing skin wounds.","followUp":null,"sourceNote":null,"answerZh":"不可以。该诊所不具备处理重大创伤相关伤害的设备，包括急性骨折处理或缝合皮肤伤口。","answerEs":"No. La clínica no está equipada para lesiones importantes relacionadas con traumatismos, incluido el tratamiento de fracturas agudas o sutura de heridas en la piel."},{"number":73,"section":"Questions not answered by the source documents","question":"What identification or paperwork should I bring?","answer":"Not specified. Ask when the clinic returns your scheduling call.","followUp":null,"sourceNote":null,"answerZh":"未指定。询问诊所何时回复您的预约电话。","answerEs":"No especificado. Pregunte cuándo la clínica le devolverá su llamada de programación."},{"number":74,"section":"Questions not answered by the source documents","question":"How long is an appointment?","answer":"Not specified.","followUp":null,"sourceNote":null,"answerZh":"未指定。","answerEs":"No especificado."},{"number":75,"section":"Questions not answered by the source documents","question":"Are laboratory tests, prescriptions, or outside imaging always free?","answer":"Appointments are described as free, but the documents do not state whether every outside medication, laboratory, imaging, or specialty cost is covered.","followUp":null,"sourceNote":null,"answerZh":"预约被描述为免费，但文件没有说明是否涵盖所有外部药物、实验室、成像或专业费用。","answerEs":"Las citas se describen como gratuitas, pero los documentos no indican si todos los costos externos de medicamentos, laboratorios, imágenes o especialidades están cubiertos."},{"number":76,"section":"Questions not answered by the source documents","question":"Which pharmacies, laboratories, imaging centers, or specialists are used?","answer":"Not specified.","followUp":null,"sourceNote":null,"answerZh":"未指定。","answerEs":"No especificado."},{"number":77,"section":"Questions not answered by the source documents","question":"Can family members attend or interpret?","answer":"Not specified. Spanish interpreters are available.","followUp":null,"sourceNote":null,"answerZh":"未指定。提供西班牙语翻译。","answerEs":"No especificado. Hay intérpretes de español disponibles."},{"number":78,"section":"Questions not answered by the source documents","question":"How are medical records requested?","answer":"Not specified. Contact the clinic by phone or email.","followUp":null,"sourceNote":null,"answerZh":"未指定。通过电话或电子邮件联系诊所。","answerEs":"No especificado. Contacta con la clínica por teléfono o correo electrónico."},{"number":79,"section":"Questions not answered by the source documents","question":"What should I do if my exact service or condition is not listed?","answer":"Call 408-715-3088, leave your name, telephone number, and reason for calling, and ask the clinic to confirm whether it can help.","followUp":null,"sourceNote":null,"answerZh":"致电408-715-3088，留下您的姓名、电话号码和致电原因，并询问诊所确认是否可以提供帮助。","answerEs":"Llame al 408-715-3088, deje su nombre, número de teléfono y motivo de la llamada, y pregunte en la clínica para confirmar si puede ayudar."}];
